  }
}

docs {
  Builds a resume PDF from the data in the body. No login needed, and nothing is saved.

  Body: a resume object. Fields (all optional): `name`, `title`, `email`, `phoneNumber`, `summary`, and the lists `skills` (`skill`, `skillLevel`), `professionalLinks` (`link`, `linkType`), `experience` (`company`, `jobTitle`, `startDate`, `endDate`, `responsibilities` as text), `education` (`institution`, `qualification`, `startDate`, `endDate`, `major`, `achievement`), `certification` (`name`, `organisation`, `credentialUrl`, `issuedDate`, `expirationDate`).
  A professional link is only shown when both `link` and `linkType` are filled in.

  Returns `200` with a PDF (`application/pdf`).
}
